# Converge: Black Lotus gives three red, and a white, a blue and a black Mox one each - six mana of four colors. X is
# four however many mana of a color was spent: Bot1 draws four, Together as One deals four to Bot2, Bot1 gains four.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Together as One
Island
Island
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{U}{B}{R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Hand.Together as One.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 2
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Life = 24
Bot1.Graveyard = Together as One; Black Lotus
